 "world": "Apex Health Clinic and related healthcare organizations undergo compliance evaluations to maintain operational licenses and government funding.",
 "rationale": {
  "m_c97b": [
   "Apex Health Clinic logged 50 completed safety audits this year and maintains a compliance score of 85, meeting the minimum policy requirements of 40 safety audits and an 80 compliance score for clinical accreditation.",
